### 7. VECTOR_ONLY 检索：普通语义问题
POST {{host}}/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": {{spaceId}},
  "query": "这个系统如何完成一次 RAG 问答？",
  "retrievalMode": "VECTOR_ONLY",
  "topK": 5,
  "candidateK": 20
}

### 8. KEYWORD_ONLY 检索：精确类名
POST {{host}}/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": {{spaceId}},
  "query": "RagRetrievalServiceImpl SearchChunksRequest",
  "retrievalMode": "KEYWORD_ONLY",
  "topK": 5,
  "candidateK": 20
}

### 9. HYBRID 检索：语义 + 技术词
POST {{host}}/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": {{spaceId}},
  "query": "EmbeddingTaskServiceImpl 如何管理 vectorize-async 向量化任务？",
  "retrievalMode": "HYBRID",
  "topK": 5,
  "candidateK": 20,
  "vectorWeight": 0.7,
  "keywordWeight": 0.3
}

### 10. HYBRID_RERANK 检索：接口路径 + 指标
POST {{host}}/api/rag/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "spaceId": {{spaceId}},
  "query": "/api/rag/eval/runs/compare 接口如何比较 EvalRun 的 MRR？",
  "retrievalMode": "HYBRID_RERANK",
  "topK": 5,
  "candidateK": 20,
  "vectorWeight": 0.7,
  "keywordWeight": 0.3
}

